flowchart TB
  accTitle: Community and optional Cloud hosting management
  accDescr: The Community host implements tenant content and a separate host administration API. Cloud hosting orchestration, local start and move flows, and optional shared sign-in are planned paths at this snapshot. Cloud management does not access messages, files or the host database.
  app["Local DorkOS app + server<br/>Agents execute here"]
  cloud["Optional Cloud hosting management<br/>Public /v1/communities contract<br/>Orchestration and launch in progress"]
  subgraph host["Community host · independently runnable"]
    admin["Host administration API · implemented<br/>Scoped machine keys · owner claims<br/>Lifecycle · limits · usage counts"]
    content["Tenant content API · implemented<br/>Membership · channels · posts · files"]
    auth["Host-wide sign-in<br/>Separate community memberships"]
    data[("PostgreSQL + tenant-owned blobs<br/>Community is content authority")]
    admin -->|"Manage containers; no content access"| data
    content --> data
    auth -->|"Authenticate; check tenant membership"| content
  end
  browser["Community browser"]
  browser <-->|"HTTP + SSE"| content
  app <-->|"Approved connection<br/>Qualified HTTP + SSE"| content
  app -.->|"Planned start / move<br/>Local server relays Cloud requests"| cloud
  cloud -.->|"Planned host API client<br/>HTTPS + scoped host key"| admin
  cloud -.->|"Later: optional OIDC sign-in<br/>Generic issuer; separate work"| auth
  classDef planned fill:#fff5e4,stroke:#a87720,color:#49320c
  class cloud planned
